6.205 Final Project 

# ColorTrace Duel

ColorTrace Duel is a real-time, FPGA-based two-player game controlled by colored object in front of a camera. The FPGA performs object tracking, path checking, and tile-based rendering in hardware.

* Two-player red/yellow object tracking
* Color thresholding and COM extraction 
* 40×40 autopath stored in BRAM
* Game FSM with start, play, life-loss, and game-over states
* Themeable renderer
* HDMI output 
* Scoreboard for lives and winner 

# Repo Structure

/hdl      Modules  
/data     PNG images and their corresponding .mem files  
/obj      Post route and synthesis reports
/sim      Test benches using Python cocotb 

# Build

1. Clone repo
3. Build and synthesize
4. Flash FPGA
5. Connect camera and HDMI to FPGA and enjoy! 

To start the game, choose a theme using switch 0 on FPGA. Confirm choice using button 3. Restart using Button 0. 

